      "writtenOn": "2022-07-20T13:11:18Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I agree with Andrew you don\u0027t need a collect here.\n\nBut if you did, you can do it as \n.collect::\u003cVec\u003c_\u003e\u003e()\n\n(The element type can be deduced, even if the container can\u0027t be.)\n\nAlternatively you could write\nlet descriptors: Vec\u003c_\u003e \u003d .....collect();",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 37,
        "startChar": 9,
        "endLine": 37,
        "endChar": 37
      },
      "revId": "7484fde9ac534261a876a9ffcf5c425cd74aafa5",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
    },
    {
