      "writtenOn": "2022-07-20T13:14:41Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "`f` is like a stream so it accumulates everything you write to it. So something like this should be equivalent:\n\n```\nwriteln!(f, \"Descriptors:\")?;\nfor descriptor in self.descriptors {\n    writeln!(f, ...)?;\n}\nOk(())\n```",
      "parentUuid": "04938f51_ae56c072",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 37,
